        <p class="lead text-xl text-zinc-300 mb-8">
          SolversPro's latest update adds a free internet speed test at speed.solverspro.com, a rebuilt PDF tools hub at solverspro.com/pdf/, and dozens of new browser-based utilities — all free with no signup.
        </p>

        <p>
          SolversPro has been busy over the past few weeks expanding, optimizing, and rebuilding our suite of free online utilities. When we started SolversPro, our mission was straightforward: create fast, lightweight, and completely private browser-based problem solvers without ads, subscriptions, or server-side data hoarding.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, we are taking a massive leap forward. With our dedicated speed test engine, our overhauled PDF workstation, and an catalog of over 80 purpose-built utilities, SolversPro gives professionals, developers, students, and tradespeople everything they need in one clean ecosystem. Here is an in-depth look at everything new in this release.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">1. Dedicated Free Internet Speed Test (speed.solverspro.com)</h2>
        <p>
          One of our most requested features is finally live: a standalone, high-precision <a href="https://speed.solverspro.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Internet Speed Test</a> deployed at <code>speed.solverspro.com</code>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Traditional speed tests on the web are notoriously frustrating. They are often overloaded with intrusive auto-playing video ads, aggressive third-party trackers, and bloated UI frameworks that consume hundreds of megabytes of RAM just to measure your throughput. Many also test against artificial cached nodes rather than real-world internet routes.
        </p>
        <p>
          The new SolversPro Speedcheck takes an entirely different approach:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Powered by Cloudflare's Edge Network:</strong> Your test connects directly to the closest edge node across Cloudflare's 330+ global cities, providing realistic, real-world connection metrics.</li>
          <li><strong>Comprehensive Metrics:</strong> Measures your download throughput, upload throughput, unloaded ping (idle latency), loaded latency, and network jitter in milliseconds.</li>
          <li><strong>Bufferbloat Diagnostics:</strong> Highlights whether your router buffers too many packets during heavy traffic, helping gamers and remote workers diagnose video-call stuttering and game lag.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Ads & 100% Privacy:</strong> No telemetry tracking, no marketing cookies, and a lightweight page load under 500 milliseconds.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You can test your broadband or cellular connection right now at <a href="https://speed.solverspro.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">speed.solverspro.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">2. Rebuilt Client-Side PDF Tools Hub (solverspro.com/pdf/)</h2>
        <p>
          Working with PDFs is an essential daily task, but most online PDF tools require you to upload sensitive documents—such as contracts, tax filings, medical reports, and bank statements—to third-party cloud servers.
        </p>
        <p>
          We have completely rebuilt the <a href="/pdf/">SolversPro PDF Hub</a> from the ground up to operate <strong>100% client-side</strong> using high-performance WebAssembly engines (<strong>pdf-lib</strong> and <strong>PDF.js</strong>). Your files are processed entirely in your computer's local memory and are never uploaded to any server.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our rebuilt suite features 12 dedicated PDF utilities:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li><strong><a href="/pdf/pdf-merger">PDF Merger</a>:</strong> Drag, drop, reorder, and combine multiple PDF files into one clean document.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/pdf/pdf-split-pages">Split PDF To Pages</a> & <a href="/pdf/pdf-split-range">Split PDF By Range</a>:</strong> Burst a document into single-page files or extract specific chapter page ranges.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/pdf/pdf-protect">Protect PDF</a> & <a href="/pdf/pdf-remove-password">Remove Password</a>:</strong> Encrypt documents with owner/user passwords or unlock protected files you own.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/pdf/pdf-flatten">Flatten PDF</a>:</strong> Collapse interactive form fields and annotations into static page content for universal printing compatibility.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/pdf/pdf-preflight">Preflight PDF</a>:</strong> Inspect document metadata, page dimensions, color spaces, and embedded font structures.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/pdf/pdf-compose">Compose PDF</a>:</strong> Draft structured text documents and export them directly into formatted PDF files.</li>
          <li><strong>Format Converters:</strong> Convert documents seamlessly with <a href="/pdf/images-to-pdf">Images to PDF</a>, <a href="/pdf/pdf-to-images">PDF to Images</a>, <a href="/pdf/pdf-to-text">PDF to Text</a>, and <a href="/pdf/pdf-to-html">PDF to HTML</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">3. Over 80 Free Tools Across 10 Practical Categories</h2>
