        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">4. How SolversPro Compares to Traditional Online Tools</h2>
        <p>
          Why choose SolversPro over legacy utility portals? Here is how our architecture stacks up against traditional tools:
        </p>

        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto">
